      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Conversation between Tom and Eric, employees at a 6/12 gas station.\r\n{This
    source cannot be verified. Proceed with caution.}\r\n\r\nTom: Hey, Eric, did
    you get the manager\u2019s message? \r\nEric: I did. Sounds ridiculous, right?\r\nTom:
    Yeah, and I don\u2019t think it\u2019s true.\r\nEric: Why do you say that? The
    video seemed legit, and there\u2019s even a scientific paper, isn\u2019t there?\r\nTom:
    Yeah, but I just had my shift, and I did as the manager said, but it didn\u2019t
    help at all. In fact, it made the slushies take longer to make.\r\nEric: I wonder
    why. Hang on. My dad has access to that O.V.T. AI-Checker. I\u2019ll ask it and
    see if this is real or not.\r\nTom: Thanks, man. No one else seems to believe
    me, and the manager just blamed me and said I did it wrong.\r\nTom: I don't think
    Derek's lying to us. I reckon he just watched that video and misunderstood what
    it was actually saying. \r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
