--- !u!114 &400560802
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 400560800}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Long ago, European scientists were baffled by a preserved creature they
    thought was an elaborate hoax. The creature is described as semi-aquatic, with
    a duck-like bill, a beaver-like tail, and webbed feet (Australian Government,
    2016). Yet if its Frankenstein-like appearance wasn\u2019t enough, its hunting
    behaviour and reproductive abilities were even stranger. \r\n\r\nTheir duck-like
    bills help them hunt in complete darkness, without sight or sound, by sensing
    electric fields generated by muscle movements in buried prey (A.M.N.H., 2024).
    They are biofluorescent and glow cyan and green under UV light, which may help
    them camouflage from predators (Ner, 2020).\r\n\r\nAlthough they are mammals,
    the females lay eggs (A.M.N.H., 2024). They even produce milk, but they have
    no nipples for babies to nurse from. Males possess venomous spurs on their hind
    legs. Their venom can cause severe and prolonged pain in humans, making them
    one of the few venomous mammals (Australian Government, 2016).\r\n\r\nToday is
    your chance to adopt one of these strange creatures and help secure this freak
    of nature\u2019s life. Adopt a Platypus today to help preserve this threatened
    species\u2019s way of life.\r\n\r\nAt one point in the past, research showed
    that unquestioning compliance could lead to blissful satisfaction; however, evolving
    psychoanalysis later found that these two phenomena were not actually as closely
    linked as previously thought.\r\n\r\nHere at the Office of Verified Truth, we\u2019re
    committed to not repeating the mistakes of the past and to continually striving
    for a better tomorrow for our company, our family, and our society as a whole.\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
